al video experience with LivePortal!\nThis innovative Mixed Reality (MR) application seamlessly blends real-time rendering, dynamic virtual content, and the real world to provide you with a free and comfortable sense of immersion.\n\nReal-Time Rendered Spatial Video: Unlike traditional pre-recorded videos, LivePortal offers an immersive six degrees of freedom (6DoF) viewing experience, bringing every scene to life.\nComfortable and Natural MR Video Experience: Say goodbye to motion sickness and intrusive space designs. LivePortal creates a content window that\u2019s perfect for long periods of immersive exploration.\nDiverse Content Selection: Explore endless possibilities with a variety of content, including real-world, virtual, and AI-generated experiences\u2014making every moment a delightful surprise.\nStart your journey with LivePortal today and step into a world of infinite possibilities!", "short_description": "LivePortal is a cutting-edge spatial video MR application that delivers a true sense of spatial immersion and offers a wide variety of captivating content."}]}, "developer_name": "SuperMorning", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/liveportal-en", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "KevinSheep", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/liveportal-main", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM